  (text "OPTO INPUTS (replaces 817 module 2ch), redesigned for 9-36 V vehicle signals\nEach channel: 3 x 1k 1206 in series (<= 0.1 W each) -> M7 reverse block -> BZT52C4V7S 4.7 V zener -> PC817C LED, 4.7k bleed across the LED.\nThreshold ~7 V (4.7 V zener + LED + diode + bleed). LED current >= 0.55 mA at 9 V and 9.8 mA at 36 V.\nALT_IN_N / PULSE_IN_N: open collector, 22k pull-up to +3V3, active LOW (firmware altActiveHigh=false).\nALT filter 22k x 100nF = 2.2 ms; PULSE filter 22k x 1nF = 22 us.\nWire ALT to the alternator L/D+ terminal or the oil-pressure switch (see esp32/docs/WIRING.md).\nIsolated: VEH_GND (J301 pin 3) is separate from GND, and the PCB has milled slots between the two sides.\nThere is no on-board jumper across the barrier; to share grounds, wire J301 pin 3 to a GND terminal (J101-2 or J701-3)."
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "95679b68-17f2-4ac1-85a6-b09fc7f30d8a")
  )
